    LLM: "Build sequences in suits where you have natural cards. Use sliding jokers at sequence ends for flexibility.\n\nCoordinate with partner via play (no verbal communication). Avoid opening sequences in same suit as partner if you might need them for a complete set. Track discard pile depthâ€”taking multiple cards requires playing at least one.\n\nComplete pure sets earn highest bonus (20 pts). Suited groups of 4 Aces or 4 Threes (laid together) score 75. Plan show requirements: 5 complete sets, 1 pure. Don't wrong-show.",
